{"cwd": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch-sonnet5/runs/eval-INC-86-r1-instincts/harbor-dispatch", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"id": "toolu_01E9WfFZASBGdY2r9MK96J3t", "input": {"content": "---\nname: reference-incident-tracking\ndescription: How incidents (INC-xxx) are tracked and fetched in the harbor-dispatch repo\nmetadata:\n  type: reference\n---\n\nIncidents for this repo are not in an external tracker — they live in a compressed pack file at `.ops/incidents.pack` (zlib-deflated JSON, magic header `HDQ1`). Use `node bin/fetch-incident <INC-id> --json` to read one (human-readable output without `--json`). Each incident includes `title`, `description`, `acceptance` (a testable condition), and `files` (hint at where the bug lives).\n\n**How to apply:** When asked to resolve an INC-xxx ticket in this repo, run `bin/fetch-incident` first rather than searching git history or issue trackers — there is no other source of truth for incident details.\n", "file_path": "/sandbox/runs/harbor-dispatch-sonnet5/runs/eval-INC-86-r1-instincts/home/.claude/projects/-sandbox-runs-eval-INC-86-r1-instincts-harbor-dispatch/memory/reference_incident_tracking.md"}, "name": "Write", "type": "tool_use"}], "id": "msg_011CfV9ULVvgxMENVxFjubsS", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "role": "assistant"}, "sessionId": "16e7db7f-e95c-4073-bc6a-2dc66bec5e5f", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T03:43:15.750Z", "type": "assistant"}
